  "content": "<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/banner.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Translate via Crowdin\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n<p>\n受夠了過度像素化、有限的畫作，而且還沒有合適的選擇界面嗎？\n沉浸式畫作允許您透過拖放、截圖或提供URL來創建自己的Minecraft風格畫作。\n不需要資源包，支持多人遊戲且易於使用。\n</p>\n<p>該模塊提供了一個簡單但強大的GUI，用於選擇畫作，其他玩家提供的畫作或通過可選數據包提供的預設畫作！默認數據包可用，快速開始！</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/selector.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p>\n<p>創作菜單允許您快速像素化您的圖像，並應用後期效果和抖動效果，使其看起來像是為Minecraft量身定制的，無需太多繁瑣的操作。</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/editor.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p>\n<p>但是，沒有精美的框架怎麼行？從不同的風格和大量材料中選擇，讓您的藝術品更加突出。</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/frames.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p>\n<p>使用智能細節層次、緩存和數據延遲流式傳輸，性能影響幾乎不可察覺。</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/multi.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p>\n<p>還提供發光的顏料！</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/glow.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p>\n<p>您的圖片有透明背景？沒問題，把它變成塗鴉噴在任何牆上！</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/alpha.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p>\n<p>以下是製配方。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=immersive_paintings:.*&dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/tree/1.20.1&resolution=48&animated=False&row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的製作圖片\"></p>\n<p>\n兼容<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/joy-of-painting\">繪畫之樂</a>！只需將畫布貼在畫作上即可展示！\n</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/joy.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p>\n<h1>伺服器管理員</h1>\n<p>\n沉浸式畫作需要傳輸和儲存圖像，在伺服器上可能會產生很大的流量。如果您的伺服器頻寬不足或儲存空間有限，請查看\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/wiki/Config\" rel=\"nofollow\">設定檔</a>。\n它允許對用戶和頻寬進行一些限制，以適應您的需求。\n</p>\n<h1>數據包</h1>\n<p>\n您可以選擇性使用\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/wiki/Custom-Paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">數據包</a>分享畫作包。\n</p>\n<h1>翻譯</h1>\n<p>\n您希望以您的語言使用這個模組？幫助在\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a>\n上翻譯此模組。\n</p>\n<h1>沉浸式合集</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Armors&description=A lot of unique and vanilla-faithful armor sets.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式盔甲\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Aircraft&description=A bunch of rustic aircraft to travel, transport, and explore!&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式飛機\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Melodies&description=Play custom melodies on various instruments and annoy your friends!&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式旋律\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Paintings&description=Drag and drop, pixelate and hang up beautiful art.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式畫作\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Optimization&description=A lightweight entity-tick-scheduler for doubling your TPS.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式優化\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=Hides the ugly block selection outline when not relevant.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"SelectiveBounds\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man of Many Planes&description=A set of additional aircraft for Immersive Aircraft with Create support in mind.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Man of Many Planes\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Machinery&description=A bunch of rustic machinery to transport, mine, and automate things.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式機械\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Furniture&description=Create custom and fancy furniture in-game or choose from a vast online library.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式傢俱\">\n</a></p>\n<h1>外掛</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings-faithful-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Faithful Addon&description=32px texture pack addon for Faithful.&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/629/725/64/64/638028066470632891.jpeg&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"忠誠外掛\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252farids-immersive-resprites\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Arids Immersive Resprites&description=Resprites for the Immersive Melodies and Immersive Paintings mods!&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/common/icons/arids-immersive-resprites.webp&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Arids沉浸式重新貼圖\">\n</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=6686e86ace76d31262ccd37a5e7f80ba\" alt=\"用於更容易的頁面部署的頁面對照表。\"></p>",
